<p>
  {dgettext("help_channels", "Prevents users from sending")}
  <.help_link topic="cmd-knock">{dgettext("help_channels", "/knock")}</.help_link>
  {dgettext("help_channels", "requests to the channel.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +K  {dgettext("help_channels", "Enable no-knock mode")}
/mode -K  {dgettext("help_channels", "Disable no-knock mode")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The letter is an upper case K. The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Details")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "When %{mode} is set, every %{command} attempt is refused. This is useful for invite-only channels that do not want to receive join requests.",
    mode: "+K",
    command: "/knock"
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The operators see nothing. The person who knocks gets an error that says knocking is disabled for the channel."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "A knock is a short request to join, sent to the operators of an invite-only channel. Turn knocks off when the channel is closed to new members, or when knock requests become noise or spam. Operators can still invite people directly."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove this mode.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Knocking only works on invite-only channels. Without invite-only mode, this mode has no visible effect."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Even with knocks allowed, each person can knock on the same channel only once per minute."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel the mode is saved and comes back after a restart."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-knock">{dgettext("help_channels", "/knock")}</.help_link>, <.help_link topic="mode-i">{dgettext("help_channels", "+i Invite Only")}</.help_link>, <.help_link topic="cmd-invite">{dgettext("help_channels", "/invite Command")}</.help_link>,
  <.help_link topic="channel-modes-overview">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Channel Modes Overview")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
